<deliverables>
Generate presentation modules under `generated/ui/` (preferred: `generated/ui/alpha_application_ui.tsx`) or `generated/alpha_application_ui.tsx`.
Do not modify tests under `tests/contracts/` or `tests/e2e/`.
Do not modify thin committed wrappers under `app/(product)/`.
Do not modify fixtures under `tests/fixtures/ui/`.
</deliverables>

<acceptance_gate>
Contract tests use only sanitized fixtures under `tests/fixtures/ui/`. No live secrets, provider calls, or network I/O.
Before generation is accepted: fixtures render without console/hydration errors; capability states match working behavior; journey gates (thesis → candidates → map/cards → research status → dossier/evidence → refresh/snapshot fallback → Next Best Action) are covered by contract and/or e2e tests when deps and generated UI are available.
Visual baselines, Playwright journey, and axe suites run when those deps and the generated module are available; until then structural + coverage matrix tests MUST pass and behavioral/e2e tests skip with explicit reasons.
Generation is never accepted if tests contact live providers or embed credentials.
</acceptance_gate>
